# YouTube Data API Key
# 1. Go to Google Cloud Console (https://console.cloud.google.com/)
# 2. Create a new project or select an existing one
# 3. Go to "APIs & Services" > "Library" and search for "YouTube Data API v3" and Enable it
# 4. Go to "Credentials", click "Create Credentials" > "API Key"
# 5. Paste the key below and rename this file to ".env" if you are using it locally.
# If deploying (e.g. Vercel/Netlify), add VITE_YOUTUBE_API_KEY to your environment variables.

VITE_YOUTUBE_API_KEY=your_youtube_api_key_here
